                    {
                        "form_id": "2b40bc2a-69f5-44a8-8120-0b3a1ce0cc4a",
                        "entry_id": "a6304d6e-93ae-3306-8dcb-975c32e1bc36",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "изме́нах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13639a2d-86c6-364a-9089-175db1ce3a32",
                        "entry_id": "a6304d6e-93ae-3306-8dcb-975c32e1bc36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "нарушение обязательств по соблюдению верности кому-, чему-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a4644d9-fb94-4c9d-ae7d-666aa5fe170d",
                                "sense_id": "13639a2d-86c6-364a-9089-175db1ce3a32",
                                "text": "Пусть непрочны домашние стены, // Пусть дорога уводит во тьму, ― // Нет на свете печальней измены, // Чем измена себе самому."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e96b3862-7593-4210-8846-b1441039e993",
                                "sense_id": "13639a2d-86c6-364a-9089-175db1ce3a32",
                                "text": "― Измена! ― крикнул Мальчиш-Кибальчиш. ¶ ― Измена! ― крикнули все его верные мальчиши. ¶ Но тут из-за дыма и огня налетела буржуинская сила, и схватила, и скрутила она Мальчиша-Кибальчиша."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "09dc6268-ef2f-3092-b603-1197e51c9824",
                        "entry_id": "a6304d6e-93ae-3306-8dcb-975c32e1bc36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг. нарк. настороженность и подозрительность, чувство страха"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66fff7b3-ba80-46de-b9be-98c5f9fa4141",
                                "sense_id": "09dc6268-ef2f-3092-b603-1197e51c9824",
                                "text": "Ладно, давай, держись. Я тебя не объявлю! Я сказал. Только сдаётся мне… измену ты словил сегодня. Лютую."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bf16434-8a53-4099-9f71-b240d0660ec3",
                                "sense_id": "09dc6268-ef2f-3092-b603-1197e51c9824",
                                "text": "Через некоторое время тетка села на измену, перезвонила мнимому драг-диллеру и договорилась встретиться в Макдональдсе. «Мне кажется, там будет меньше шансов напороться на полицейских», ― сказала Ами и отправилась прямо в лапы копов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3360be8f-502b-4741-a990-6921f85da5f2",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6304d6e-93ae-3306-8dcb-975c32e1bc36",
                        "target_lang_word": "betrayal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "betrayal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e099f56-adbe-3f18-a87f-8de1beb56c45",
                                        "entry_id": "ed007d7e-8ad3-3ce7-a0bf-be3e50f842e5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of betraying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11189700-7340-4b44-b318-a12d7aa58e64",
                                                "sense_id": "6e099f56-adbe-3f18-a87f-8de1beb56c45",
                                                "text": "But by the same token, an exclusive menu of betrayals is likely to be a starvation diet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "347a143f-66bf-4dd6-9265-40b30c96a3e7",
                                                "sense_id": "6e099f56-adbe-3f18-a87f-8de1beb56c45",
                                                "text": "The betrayal of our friends in Taiwan began with President Carter’s decision to terminate the mutual defense treaty with Taiwan that Congress had ratified in 1954."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4b1c89f-65df-4518-b9b4-fe06c05efd79",
                                                "sense_id": "6e099f56-adbe-3f18-a87f-8de1beb56c45",
                                                "text": "One of our own has joined with the alien. If you see him, do not hesitate to let him know what the Roekaar think of this betrayal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b04682f3-a4df-4954-be7f-6b0034788fd7",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6304d6e-93ae-3306-8dcb-975c32e1bc36",
                        "target_lang_word": "treason",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "treason",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9db7b9e5-1dd1-3ab4-a782-86dd643eb0e9",
                                        "entry_id": "082937ed-ca24-3bd6-9baa-8e5c05ab9dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The crime of betraying one’s own country."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b26e92cb-c38a-449f-9341-a1fe73d11d2d",
                                                "sense_id": "9db7b9e5-1dd1-3ab4-a782-86dd643eb0e9",
                                                "text": "Treaſon doth never [pro]ſper: what's the reaſon? / For yf yt [pro]ſper none dare call yt treaſon"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8a0fdf6-1484-4d1a-9106-80198bc0a467",
                                                "sense_id": "9db7b9e5-1dd1-3ab4-a782-86dd643eb0e9",
                                                "text": "Treason against the United States, shall consist only in levying War against them, or in adhering to their Enemies, giving them Aid and Comfort. No Person shall be convicted of Treason unleſs on the Testimony of two Witneſses to the same overt Act, or on Confeſsion in open Court."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fae402c-9f0b-4bbf-8dc5-958c5cc6c14e",
                                                "sense_id": "9db7b9e5-1dd1-3ab4-a782-86dd643eb0e9",
                                                "text": "If for every error and every act of incompetence one can substitute an act of treason, many points of fascinating interpretation are open to the paranoid imagination: treason in high places can be found at almost every turning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96842da8-fa3f-4235-96ba-77731983f198",
                                                "sense_id": "9db7b9e5-1dd1-3ab4-a782-86dd643eb0e9",
                                                "text": "M. Vonel: 'Your involvement with a group calling themselves THE ORDER OF THE EZIC STAR has been uncovered. […] At least one EZIC member has confessed to receiving your help. This represents treason of the highest order. Goodbye inspector.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d745db41-536c-30b3-bd9c-104bb7f503af",
                                        "entry_id": "082937ed-ca24-3bd6-9baa-8e5c05ab9dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of treachery, betrayal of trust or confidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b1360cd0-0388-47e1-b679-fcafe2ba0a99",
